#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:10002
#: ebde292b391647e1b6ab1fd119848b38
msgid "Signal Extraction: Weak Signal Recovery from Colored Noise"
msgstr "信号抽出: 色付き雑音からの微弱信号回収"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:20002
#: 03aa8763547d4cbbb3ce9f9bd35065e5
msgid ""
"This case study promotes the legacy weak-signal notebook into the public "
"gallery. The core physics question is how to recover a narrowband signal "
"whose amplitude is far below the raw time-domain noise."
msgstr ""
"このケーススタディは legacy の weak-signal notebook を公開 gallery "
"向けに整理したものです。物理的に見たいのは、生波形では見えない狭帯域信号をどうやって回収するかです。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:20004
#: c9fd42f8ebfd4760b9eab03d7ad8279b
msgid ""
"The workflow is: simulate a weak injected tone, identify it spectrally, "
"isolate it with a band-pass filter, and fit a compact sinusoidal model."
msgstr "ここでは弱い単色線を注入し、ASD で候補周波数を見つけ、band-pass で取り出してから簡単な正弦波モデルを当てます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:20006
#: c4fffc484ebc47c380bbf050022cb7a6
msgid ""
"**Related API**: [Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst), "
"[Signal API](../../reference/api/signal.rst)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: [Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst), [Signal "
"API](../../reference/api/signal.rst)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:20007
#: 0279889bcc57468992583904f3a4a08c
msgid ""
"**Related theory**: [Validated "
"Algorithms](../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md), [Numerical "
"Stability](../../explanation/numerical_stability.md)"
msgstr ""
"**関連理論**: "
"[検証済みアルゴリズム](../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md)、[数値的安定性](../../explanation/numerical_stability.md)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:40002
#: 17302f6e31234c91ab112ffa1d441e49
msgid "1. Find the candidate frequency band"
msgstr "1\\. 候補帯域を見つける"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:40004
#: bba40a56603d426b94038f0fccdf2844
msgid ""
"ASD averaging reduces estimator variance so the narrowband tone can emerge "
"as a statistically visible line even when the time-domain waveform looks "
"noise dominated."
msgstr "ASD の平均化は推定分散を減らすので、時間波形では見えない狭帯域線が統計的に見えるようになります。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:60002
#: 154bf4a43876412ea3d7bf6268dd02fd
msgid "2. Filter and fit the recovered signal"
msgstr "2\\. フィルタしてフィットする"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:60004
#: 10c10c08cfdb44c0a6e6d5a0a9ea8208
msgid ""
"The band-pass is chosen to keep the injected line while rejecting unrelated "
"broadband power. Making the band too narrow or too wide would respectively "
"distort the tone or let too much noise back in."
msgstr ""
"band-pass は注入線を残しつつ不要な広帯域成分を落とすためのものです。帯域を狭くしすぎると波形を歪め、広くしすぎると雑音を戻してしまいます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_signal_extraction.ipynb:60006
#: a0e617692ded4c149779f1b743b98d7f
msgid ""
"**Related API**: [Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst), "
"[Fitting API](../../reference/api/fitting.rst)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: [Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst), [Fitting "
"API](../../reference/api/fitting.rst)"

